'''Fungal Ground''' is a [[ground effect]] that buffs allies and debuffs enemies. Allies gain 25% [[chaos]] [[resistance]] while on Fungal Ground, while enemies have all resistances lowered by 10%.

==Stats==
* {{c|mod|Allies on your Fungal Ground gain +25% to Chaos Resistance}}
* {{c|mod|Enemies on your Fungal Ground have -10% to all Resistances}}

